:construction: Set `GOPROXY=https://proxy.golang.org|direct` in Go-running workflows and their templates so proxy errors can fall back to source repositories, reducing CI failures from transient HTTP/2 and proxy outages ([golang/go#51323](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/51323), [golang/go#55162](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/55162)). The pipe separator permits fallback on any error, whereas the default comma permits it only for HTTP 404/410 ([Go documentation](https://go.dev/doc/go1.15#go-command)).
